        <activityName xml:lang="en">Poultry litter pellets, burned in furnace, ash to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Poultry litter pellets, burned in furnace, ash to landfarming
Air emission data completed with the inventory of wood chips, from forest, mixed, burned in furnace 300kW;
UUID: 7ffc6dd1-6b2c-3d47-875c-4aa83df14504
This data set includes fuel, infrastructure, ash disposal and air emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: grate furnace 300kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ffc6dd1-6b2c-3d47-875c-4aa83df14504.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
